(4059661, 580557, 82814, '<td valign="top">I like the title a lot and the fact that somebody was willing to attempt to make a spent blossom look beautiful is refreshing.  I think you have succeeded here as the colours are very complimentary, true and in a rich tone echoing the depth of colour in the spent blossom.  I also like that it is off centre.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the title a lot and the fact that somebody was willing to attempt to make a spent blossom look beautiful is refreshing.  I think you have succeeded here as the colours are very complimentary, true and in a rich tone echoing the depth of colour in the spent blossom.  I also like that it is off centre.  Well done.', '2007-09-05 03:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4059679, 581628, 82814, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. If this were my photograph I might have called it the bee''s sneeze because he has it all over himself.  My only observation is I would have preferred to see the bee lighter coloured.  I like this capture a lot.</td>', 'Excellent capture. If this were my photograph I might have called it the bee''s sneeze because he has it all over himself.  My only observation is I would have preferred to see the bee lighter coloured.  I like this capture a lot.', '2007-09-05 03:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4059689, 580374, 82814, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see a facial expression - one typical of a ref making a call.  Or even if he were blowing his whistle, then photographing the back side of the ref would be acceptable.  For me this is simply a stripped shirt in front of a blurred background.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see a facial expression - one typical of a ref making a call.  Or even if he were blowing his whistle, then photographing the back side of the ref would be acceptable.  For me this is simply a stripped shirt in front of a blurred background.', '2007-09-05 04:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4059691, 579112, 82814, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple &amp; raw are words that come to mind.  I haven''t decided if I like it or not.  It seems to be missing something (for me).</td>', 'Clean, simple & raw are words that come to mind.  I haven''t decided if I like it or not.  It seems to be missing something (for me).', '2007-09-05 04:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
