(4060528, 582556, 82493, '<td valign="top">A little confused by this one. If Z71 is the focal point of the image, shouldn''t it be in focus? And if it''s not, and she is the focal point, shouldn''t she have a better expression? Not quite sure about this.</td>', 'A little confused by this one. If Z71 is the focal point of the image, shouldn''t it be in focus? And if it''s not, and she is the focal point, shouldn''t she have a better expression? Not quite sure about this.', '2007-09-05 09:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
