(4062233, 581476, 12802, '<td valign="top">A good example of Bokeh, nice!<br/> <br/>Sometime using different monitors makes some images look different, i.e on one laptop it''s difficult to see the background here (not your fault, my crappy monitor) but it''s a good idea to check that as many users as possible can view it.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would have liked to see here would be a little sharpening over the whole image.  I''ve done a simple sharpen to your image myself in photoshop and it really brings out the detail in the wings.<br/> <br/>A good example, I give you 8 out of 10.</td>', 'A good example of Bokeh, nice! Sometime using different monitors makes some images look different, i.e on one laptop it''s difficult to see the background here (not your fault, my crappy monitor) but it''s a good idea to check that as many users as possible can view it. The only thing I would have liked to see here would be a little sharpening over the whole image.  I''ve done a simple sharpen to your image myself in photoshop and it really brings out the detail in the wings. A good example, I give you 8 out of 10.', '2007-09-05 16:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
