(4063432, 579650, 77521, '<td valign="top">usually i don''t like when borders are added, but in my opinion it really adds to this shot!</td>', 'usually i don''t like when borders are added, but in my opinion it really adds to this shot!', '2007-09-05 22:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063438, 582130, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, and I think it''s more challenging to have the background use the same color as the foreground and still have the subject stand out so well.  I might have rotated it a bit so the flower was primarily leaning into the picture instead of out of it; it just feels slightly off-balance to me compositionally.  Excellent entry overall.</td>', 'Nicely done, and I think it''s more challenging to have the background use the same color as the foreground and still have the subject stand out so well.  I might have rotated it a bit so the flower was primarily leaning into the picture instead of out of it; it just feels slightly off-balance to me compositionally.  Excellent entry overall.', '2007-09-05 22:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063446, 582520, 65234, '<td valign="top">That blue is just stunning!  It really sets off the bird beautifully without looking oversaturated.  The brownish edges of the waves are a nice echo of the bird''s color.  Actually wish there were a few more of them to add a bit more interest to the background.  Very nice overall.</td>', 'That blue is just stunning!  It really sets off the bird beautifully without looking oversaturated.  The brownish edges of the waves are a nice echo of the bird''s color.  Actually wish there were a few more of them to add a bit more interest to the background.  Very nice overall.', '2007-09-05 22:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063459, 582519, 65234, '<td valign="top">Flower looks a little soft to me but the background is decidedly complementary in colors and tones.  Would prefer that one bright vertical line on the left was following the direction of the other lines instead of crossing them, and I would rotate just a bit to put the stem smack in the corner and crop a bit more off the top for balance.  Nice effect overall, despite my nitpicking.</td>', 'Flower looks a little soft to me but the background is decidedly complementary in colors and tones.  Would prefer that one bright vertical line on the left was following the direction of the other lines instead of crossing them, and I would rotate just a bit to put the stem smack in the corner and crop a bit more off the top for balance.  Nice effect overall, despite my nitpicking.', '2007-09-05 23:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063460, 581294, 73601, '<td valign="top">great balance of light and wonderful bokeh</td>', 'great balance of light and wonderful bokeh', '2007-09-05 23:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063464, 579205, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice find for this challenge!  I can just barely see those threads suspending the twig and the background is nicely complementary, light and dark in all the right places.</td>', 'Very nice find for this challenge!  I can just barely see those threads suspending the twig and the background is nicely complementary, light and dark in all the right places.', '2007-09-05 23:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
