(4065280, 581585, 81664, '<td valign="top">Very antique-ish. I wish the rose was a tad more in focus. It is a very different shot. The more I stare, the more I like it!</td>', 'Very antique-ish. I wish the rose was a tad more in focus. It is a very different shot. The more I stare, the more I like it!', '2007-09-06 13:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
