(4065286, 582139, 81664, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is gorgeous, almost more interesting than your subject. The flowers are a bit cluttered. I do like the photo though</td>', 'The bokeh is gorgeous, almost more interesting than your subject. The flowers are a bit cluttered. I do like the photo though', '2007-09-06 13:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
