(4065320, 581733, 69368, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea! Love the reflection in the bubble! You''ve done a great job! - 10 -</td>', 'Fantastic idea! Love the reflection in the bubble! You''ve done a great job! - 10 -', '2007-09-06 13:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065321, 580588, 81664, '<td valign="top">You have great focus (or lack of it) on the web and the background is really awesome. The spider looks almost too sharpened, but not in focus enough.</td>', 'You have great focus (or lack of it) on the web and the background is really awesome. The spider looks almost too sharpened, but not in focus enough.', '2007-09-06 13:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065322, 582314, 81664, '<td valign="top">OH he is just stunning. What a crisp focus too, awesome color. 9!</td>', 'OH he is just stunning. What a crisp focus too, awesome color. 9!', '2007-09-06 13:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065324, 580404, 81664, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see the bokeh here, and it looks a bit blurry. But it is a great composition! You captured him with a great expression!</td>', 'I don''t really see the bokeh here, and it looks a bit blurry. But it is a great composition! You captured him with a great expression!', '2007-09-06 13:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065326, 582502, 81664, '<td valign="top">A little too cluttered I think. The main bursting rose doesn''t stand out from the little buds in front. Nice bokeh in the background though.</td>', 'A little too cluttered I think. The main bursting rose doesn''t stand out from the little buds in front. Nice bokeh in the background though.', '2007-09-06 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065331, 581602, 81664, '<td valign="top">wow, what pretty bokeh in front and back...but it almost takes over the photo, and you don''t notice its main subject: the web. <br/> <br/>The green branch is in the way, and distracting. <br/> <br/>The web looks to be absolutely gorgeous, with that little bit of rainbow...but you really don''t notice it due to the foreground and background being so dominant. I wish you got closer to the web! I am still scoring a 7!</td>', 'wow, what pretty bokeh in front and back...but it almost takes over the photo, and you don''t notice its main subject: the web.  The green branch is in the way, and distracting.  The web looks to be absolutely gorgeous, with that little bit of rainbow...but you really don''t notice it due to the foreground and background being so dominant. I wish you got closer to the web! I am still scoring a 7!', '2007-09-06 13:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065333, 581422, 81664, '<td valign="top">Very different subject matter. I like it. Great bokeh in the background. Nice DoF in the front too.</td>', 'Very different subject matter. I like it. Great bokeh in the background. Nice DoF in the front too.', '2007-09-06 13:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065336, 582229, 81664, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, it isn''t in focus. It really looks like a great subject, but you can''t really see it. It sort of blends into itself.<br/> <br/>But awesome color for bokeh!</td>', 'I am sorry, it isn''t in focus. It really looks like a great subject, but you can''t really see it. It sort of blends into itself. But awesome color for bokeh!', '2007-09-06 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065337, 579993, 81664, '<td valign="top">The bokeh looks like a painting! Just gorgeous!<br/> <br/>But I would have loved to see the cat a bit closer, or perhaps looking at the camera. It would have been awesome against that background!</td>', 'The bokeh looks like a painting! Just gorgeous! But I would have loved to see the cat a bit closer, or perhaps looking at the camera. It would have been awesome against that background!', '2007-09-06 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065342, 582524, 81664, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is quite different. I love the transparency in the wings. Love that everything else is solid black!! Great bokeh! a 9!</td>', 'Wow, this is quite different. I love the transparency in the wings. Love that everything else is solid black!! Great bokeh! a 9!', '2007-09-06 13:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065344, 579453, 81664, '<td valign="top">Oh how cute. I love the crisp focus on the left eye. I really like this photo! 8!</td>', 'Oh how cute. I love the crisp focus on the left eye. I really like this photo! 8!', '2007-09-06 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065346, 581699, 82112, '<td valign="top">Really like this one. Nice bokeh &amp; geometry!</td>', 'Really like this one. Nice bokeh & geometry!', '2007-09-06 13:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065348, 580990, 81664, '<td valign="top">OH I love the way all your subjects are "sun bathing!"<br/> <br/>I really love your photo, if I was forced to say something critical, it would be that the bottom of the sunflower wasn''t cropped off.</td>', 'OH I love the way all your subjects are "sun bathing!" I really love your photo, if I was forced to say something critical, it would be that the bottom of the sunflower wasn''t cropped off.', '2007-09-06 13:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065356, 582244, 81664, '<td valign="top">What a great idea, but you really can''t see it. A macro focus would have done wonders, pulling in really close to show the details. As it is now, you really can''t see the tiny star.</td>', 'What a great idea, but you really can''t see it. A macro focus would have done wonders, pulling in really close to show the details. As it is now, you really can''t see the tiny star.', '2007-09-06 13:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065361, 582561, 81664, '<td valign="top">Oh his little fingers are FANTASTIC! He almost looks like a little Sharpe dog with a wrinkled face. How unique. I give you a 9!</td>', 'Oh his little fingers are FANTASTIC! He almost looks like a little Sharpe dog with a wrinkled face. How unique. I give you a 9!', '2007-09-06 13:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065369, 582253, 81664, '<td valign="top">Oh he looks very commanding! Love his furry face! I like this photo!</td>', 'Oh he looks very commanding! Love his furry face! I like this photo!', '2007-09-06 13:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065372, 582567, 81664, '<td valign="top">It is a great idea, but just not crisp enough in focus.</td>', 'It is a great idea, but just not crisp enough in focus.', '2007-09-06 13:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
