(4065581, 582517, 82088, '<td valign="top">Cool close up of this little guy.  The lighting in this picture is harsh, and makes it a hard picture to look at.  I wished the background were a different color to make the praying mantis stand out, but that is probably something that couldn''t be helped. :)  It also seems to me that the focus is on the ground just in front of the praying mantis and not on him.</td>', 'Cool close up of this little guy.  The lighting in this picture is harsh, and makes it a hard picture to look at.  I wished the background were a different color to make the praying mantis stand out, but that is probably something that couldn''t be helped. :)  It also seems to me that the focus is on the ground just in front of the praying mantis and not on him.', '2007-09-06 15:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4065586, 581257, 82088, '<td valign="top">Pretty!  It seems it is slightly tilted though, and I wish the few leaves that are sticking out on the left were cropped out, and the colors  were a little more bold and bright.  Unfortunately, I don''t believe this picture meets the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty!  It seems it is slightly tilted though, and I wish the few leaves that are sticking out on the left were cropped out, and the colors  were a little more bold and bright.  Unfortunately, I don''t believe this picture meets the challenge.', '2007-09-06 15:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
