(4066969, 581257, 75034, '<td valign="top">This would have worked a lot better if the background was out of focus all together and not foggy. It would have caputred the meaning of the bokeh challenge better. Looking at it in the overall. I like the fog or mist and the DOF on the drift wood is spot on. You leave no doubt that this is a quiet and beautiful place to be and I would love to be you and be there in the fall. Still in spite of it all wishing you the best of luck in this challenge.  :-}  MAX!</td>', 'This would have worked a lot better if the background was out of focus all together and not foggy. It would have caputred the meaning of the bokeh challenge better. Looking at it in the overall. I like the fog or mist and the DOF on the drift wood is spot on. You leave no doubt that this is a quiet and beautiful place to be and I would love to be you and be there in the fall. Still in spite of it all wishing you the best of luck in this challenge.  :-}  MAX!', '2007-09-06 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
