(4075508, 581861, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice sharp focus on the dog - good work on the smoothness of the background.  I really feal this would be so much better with a much closer crop on the dog - there is so much blank space on the left and the collar is distracting.  including only the dog''s head and background would really take this one up a notch.</td>', 'nice sharp focus on the dog - good work on the smoothness of the background.  I really feal this would be so much better with a much closer crop on the dog - there is so much blank space on the left and the collar is distracting.  including only the dog''s head and background would really take this one up a notch.', '2007-09-09 18:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075512, 581612, 67152, '<td valign="top">great bokeh and good sharp focus on the blossom - the leaves in the lower right are distracting - a closer crop might help</td>', 'great bokeh and good sharp focus on the blossom - the leaves in the lower right are distracting - a closer crop might help', '2007-09-09 18:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
