(4076020, 582524, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice sillhouette.  The bokeh is so big, you almost can''t see it.  I''m not keen on the browny colours here though.</td>', 'Wow, nice sillhouette.  The bokeh is so big, you almost can''t see it.  I''m not keen on the browny colours here though.', '2007-09-09 23:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
