(4076058, 582268, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro abstract.  I love the detail in the drops.  It would be nice if the in-focus drops could occupy a little more of the picture.  There''s lots of background, and only a very small strip of foreground interest.</td>', 'Interesting macro abstract.  I love the detail in the drops.  It would be nice if the in-focus drops could occupy a little more of the picture.  There''s lots of background, and only a very small strip of foreground interest.', '2007-09-09 23:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
