(4078673, 582383, 84040, '<td valign="top">this is an amazing shot. it isnt the typical baseball field, world series, famous baseball player shot. this shot brings memories and fun. it is a shot that can withstand time. it is rustic, and simple and the way you focused in on the baseball really emphasizes the whole experience.</td>', 'this is an amazing shot. it isnt the typical baseball field, world series, famous baseball player shot. this shot brings memories and fun. it is a shot that can withstand time. it is rustic, and simple and the way you focused in on the baseball really emphasizes the whole experience.', '2007-09-10 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078681, 582462, 84040, '<td valign="top">this shot is mysterious and alluring at the same time. your title is very fitting to the shot and whatever the actual object is, you did a very good job capturing a part of it and making it into a sort of whimsical way.</td>', 'this shot is mysterious and alluring at the same time. your title is very fitting to the shot and whatever the actual object is, you did a very good job capturing a part of it and making it into a sort of whimsical way.', '2007-09-10 17:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
