(4078702, 581588, 84040, '<td valign="top">the title is intriguing, for some reason your photo really captures the essence of the title. although the photo shows nothing but natural objects, the composition gives off the feel of an actual piano.</td>', 'the title is intriguing, for some reason your photo really captures the essence of the title. although the photo shows nothing but natural objects, the composition gives off the feel of an actual piano.', '2007-09-10 17:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
