(4078719, 582314, 84040, '<td valign="top">maybe it was the lighting? but this bird has spectacular colors and perhaps there is a better way to emphasize the colors.</td>', 'maybe it was the lighting? but this bird has spectacular colors and perhaps there is a better way to emphasize the colors.', '2007-09-10 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078722, 580557, 84040, '<td valign="top">this photo is exquisite; however, the title of your photo doesn''t really capture the essence of the photo.</td>', 'this photo is exquisite; however, the title of your photo doesn''t really capture the essence of the photo.', '2007-09-10 17:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078728, 582143, 84040, '<td valign="top">the macro is exquisite here. the detail of the metal on the pen is phenomenon. the writing tha tis blurred in the background really adds a touch.</td>', 'the macro is exquisite here. the detail of the metal on the pen is phenomenon. the writing tha tis blurred in the background really adds a touch.', '2007-09-10 17:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4078739, 582201, 84040, '<td valign="top">the blurry outter core of the object versus the sharpness of the inner core of the object really contrast each other in a good way. the green in the middle also emphasizes the dull monotoned color of the rust and the rust adds texture. although, this photo i think is almost dream like and the title "rust" is not very fitting to such a creative image.</td>', 'the blurry outter core of the object versus the sharpness of the inner core of the object really contrast each other in a good way. the green in the middle also emphasizes the dull monotoned color of the rust and the rust adds texture. although, this photo i think is almost dream like and the title "rust" is not very fitting to such a creative image.', '2007-09-10 17:53:34.000000', NULL, 1);
