(4080337, 581651, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hmm, now where have I seen lots of ribbon winning dragonflies before?  PugH?  A very familiar style, but a nice image.  I don''t like the black bar borders though.</td>', 'Hmm, now where have I seen lots of ribbon winning dragonflies before?  PugH?  A very familiar style, but a nice image.  I don''t like the black bar borders though.', '2007-09-11 07:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
