(4080374, 581839, 39430, '<td valign="top">White balance is a little too blue, evident in the monkey''s eyes and teeth.  Try setting it to shady white balance, or adjusting in PP.</td>', 'White balance is a little too blue, evident in the monkey''s eyes and teeth.  Try setting it to shady white balance, or adjusting in PP.', '2007-09-11 08:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
