(4080385, 582232, 39430, '<td valign="top">Try using the shade white balance setting to make it less blue, or fix the WB in PP.  The bokeh is also not very significant in this image.  Probably a limitation of your camera (a P&amp;S?), but getting the background further from the subject will help.</td>', 'Try using the shade white balance setting to make it less blue, or fix the WB in PP.  The bokeh is also not very significant in this image.  Probably a limitation of your camera (a P&S?), but getting the background further from the subject will help.', '2007-09-11 08:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080389, 580642, 39430, '<td valign="top">Get her off there!  There''s a train coming!  Ah, what a waste.  :)  This image might be improved with a little bit of colour.</td>', 'Get her off there!  There''s a train coming!  Ah, what a waste.  :)  This image might be improved with a little bit of colour.', '2007-09-11 08:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080391, 582259, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the water droplets.  You get extra points for that, but I''m not a big fan of more flower photos.  Sorry.  :(</td>', 'I like the water droplets.  You get extra points for that, but I''m not a big fan of more flower photos.  Sorry.  :(', '2007-09-11 08:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080395, 579218, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hmm, sorry, it''s just not very interesting, and the beads that are in focus are still difficult to see because of the high contrast.</td>', 'Hmm, sorry, it''s just not very interesting, and the beads that are in focus are still difficult to see because of the high contrast.', '2007-09-11 08:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080400, 582222, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, but not quite in focus anywhere.  I''d also be inclined to crop it closer.</td>', 'Interesting effect, but not quite in focus anywhere.  I''d also be inclined to crop it closer.', '2007-09-11 08:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080402, 580510, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and cool lighting.  The bottom half is a little too dark though, but overall, very good.</td>', 'Nice colours and cool lighting.  The bottom half is a little too dark though, but overall, very good.', '2007-09-11 08:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4080406, 581930, 39430, '<td valign="top">He''s pretty scruffy looking, and not ideally posed.  Don''t you hate it when models just won''t do what you ask them?  :)</td>', 'He''s pretty scruffy looking, and not ideally posed.  Don''t you hate it when models just won''t do what you ask them?  :)', '2007-09-11 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
