(4080412, 578917, 39430, '<td valign="top">Would be a lot better if he was looking at the camera with his one eye, as it would anchor him in the frame instead of falling off the edge.</td>', 'Would be a lot better if he was looking at the camera with his one eye, as it would anchor him in the frame instead of falling off the edge.', '2007-09-11 08:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
