(4080477, 581730, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting quirky fun shot.  Unfortunately, it''s not quite in focus on the subject.  Stop it down a little, and you''d possibly have a much sharper image, and still have plenty of bokeh.  Overall, I still like it though.</td>', 'Interesting quirky fun shot.  Unfortunately, it''s not quite in focus on the subject.  Stop it down a little, and you''d possibly have a much sharper image, and still have plenty of bokeh.  Overall, I still like it though.', '2007-09-11 08:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
