(4083132, 581916, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hey, this person looks familiar lol.  Nice job with doing something different than plant life (like I did lol).  Love how the eyes show great concentration.</td>', 'Hey, this person looks familiar lol.  Nice job with doing something different than plant life (like I did lol).  Love how the eyes show great concentration.', '2007-09-12 01:40:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4083138, 579150, 62318, '<td valign="top">Personally, this is near perfect bokeh. The background is smooth and buttery without any harsh transitions. Some people love the little aperature circles for some reason even though it really isn''t what bokeh is all about.</td>', 'Personally, this is near perfect bokeh. The background is smooth and buttery without any harsh transitions. Some people love the little aperature circles for some reason even though it really isn''t what bokeh is all about.', '2007-09-12 01:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
