(4083368, 581872, 51799, '<td valign="top">Hey Jeff - the rose is nice, but I think I would have liked more color in the background bokeh - more spots of color, rather than so much green.  Maybe a tighter crop (taking from the left side) would have helped?  - Betsy</td>', 'Hey Jeff - the rose is nice, but I think I would have liked more color in the background bokeh - more spots of color, rather than so much green.  Maybe a tighter crop (taking from the left side) would have helped?  - Betsy', '2007-09-12 03:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4083381, 581433, 25355, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. If that dragonfly is anything like the similar-looking blue dragonflies here in Japan, you''ve done a very good job at capturing it (they invariably fly away if you approach them here...).</td>', 'Very nice shot. If that dragonfly is anything like the similar-looking blue dragonflies here in Japan, you''ve done a very good job at capturing it (they invariably fly away if you approach them here...).', '2007-09-12 03:14:54.000000', NULL, 0),
