(4083472, 581699, 42198, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon. This is a superb shot. And yes, it''s a European garden spider (Araneus diadematus) you''ve got there. I''m so jealous of the nice dof you got on the web and the perfect lighting. (Check my profile for my attempt at the same species, similar angle), you really nailed the background as well.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon. This is a superb shot. And yes, it''s a European garden spider (Araneus diadematus) you''ve got there. I''m so jealous of the nice dof you got on the web and the perfect lighting. (Check my profile for my attempt at the same species, similar angle), you really nailed the background as well.', '2007-09-12 04:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4083484, 581476, 82897, '<td valign="top">This really is straight out of the camera.<br/><b>Absolutely nothing done to it. </b> <br/> <br/>Still must remember how complex I can make things and still call it "Straight out of the camera".</td>', 'This really is straight out of the camera.Absolutely nothing done to it.   Still must remember how complex I can make things and still call it "Straight out of the camera".', '2007-09-12 04:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
