(4083492, 581699, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, its a really nice idea, and looks good, but seems a tad oversharpened and even a tad out of focus on the spider? that has been saved slightly with the oversharpening though.  <br/>On the plus side the use of foreground AND background bokeh is truely stunning and the colours are beautiful and compliment the whole image wonderfully.<br/> <br/>Still, the voters loved it and granted it is very creative, which I guess we should be encouraging on DPC.. well done on the blue.<br/> <br/>On, one last thing, you are SOOOOOO close to breaking the 6 barrier for your overall average score over all challenges.. Being in the "6" club is a great achievement, I am sure you will get there with your next challenge.. <br/> <br/></td>', 'OK, its a really nice idea, and looks good, but seems a tad oversharpened and even a tad out of focus on the spider? that has been saved slightly with the oversharpening though.  On the plus side the use of foreground AND background bokeh is truely stunning and the colours are beautiful and compliment the whole image wonderfully. Still, the voters loved it and granted it is very creative, which I guess we should be encouraging on DPC.. well done on the blue. On, one last thing, you are SOOOOOO close to breaking the 6 barrier for your overall average score over all challenges.. Being in the "6" club is a great achievement, I am sure you will get there with your next challenge..  ', '2007-09-12 05:23:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4083498, 581433, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow, I had to look twice after finding that this is your first ribbon - I thought for sure you had several. Well, you''re on your way! Congrats!</td>', 'Wow, I had to look twice after finding that this is your first ribbon - I thought for sure you had several. Well, you''re on your way! Congrats!', '2007-09-12 05:26:12.000000', NULL, 0),
