(4084170, 582306, 30982, '<td valign="top">It didn''t score better because no one particularly likes dead butterflies.  Sure, they die, but we like ''em better when they''re alive.  Besides, they''re easier to shoot when they''re dead since they aren''t flitting all over the place.  Nice bokeh, though and a good composition, even with the tilted horizon.</td>', 'It didn''t score better because no one particularly likes dead butterflies.  Sure, they die, but we like ''em better when they''re alive.  Besides, they''re easier to shoot when they''re dead since they aren''t flitting all over the place.  Nice bokeh, though and a good composition, even with the tilted horizon.', '2007-09-12 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 0),
