(4084229, 581732, 53572, '<td valign="top">lovely, tiny depth of field.  the colours work really well.  did you try it witha square crop?  that seems to make the insect a little easier to see.</td>', 'lovely, tiny depth of field.  the colours work really well.  did you try it witha square crop?  that seems to make the insect a little easier to see.', '2007-09-12 11:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4084236, 582495, 53572, '<td valign="top">hey shez, a nice shot.  however, i think agree with the comments about the processing.  you have a very recognizable, signature style that works very well on most of your images.  however, here, with the detail in the bird and other textures, it seems a bit much.  i''d like to see with a little less smoothing</td>', 'hey shez, a nice shot.  however, i think agree with the comments about the processing.  you have a very recognizable, signature style that works very well on most of your images.  however, here, with the detail in the bird and other textures, it seems a bit much.  i''d like to see with a little less smoothing', '2007-09-12 11:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4084247, 581712, 53572, '<td valign="top">some very nice colours here, but a bit visually confusing.  the beads are very busy, with not a lot contrast to make them stand out.  with a larger aperture, and thus a smaller depth of field, i think this might have been a much more effective image.</td>', 'some very nice colours here, but a bit visually confusing.  the beads are very busy, with not a lot contrast to make them stand out.  with a larger aperture, and thus a smaller depth of field, i think this might have been a much more effective image.', '2007-09-12 11:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
