(4087233, 580943, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh wow!  What a beautiful magical photo.  Those blue tones reach down and just grab the soul!   Congratultions on First Page honors with this awesome photo.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh wow!  What a beautiful magical photo.  Those blue tones reach down and just grab the soul!   Congratultions on First Page honors with this awesome photo. ', '2007-09-13 11:40:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087234, 581651, 24454, '<td valign="top">Techo!!!  You are THE BOMB!!!  Man, look how you can see every single little fuzzy hair on his little head and back -- and every little vein in his wing!<br/> <br/>WOW!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Techo!!!  You are THE BOMB!!!  Man, look how you can see every single little fuzzy hair on his little head and back -- and every little vein in his wing! WOW! ', '2007-09-13 11:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087280, 582504, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a FABULOUS bird photo!   Wow!  National Geographic quality!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, what a FABULOUS bird photo!   Wow!  National Geographic quality! ', '2007-09-13 12:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087286, 581294, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  So deep and rich in light and color!  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Awesome!  So deep and rich in light and color!   ', '2007-09-13 12:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087289, 582437, 24454, '<td valign="top">How breathtakingly fresh and stunning.   The orange bokeh gives it such a dreamy lovely look!<br/> <br/></td>', 'How breathtakingly fresh and stunning.   The orange bokeh gives it such a dreamy lovely look! ', '2007-09-13 12:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087292, 582182, 24454, '<td valign="top">BEEEEEAUTIFUL!   How fortunate to have your circles of light be such a gorgeous blue and white.  It compliments the leaf so well.  The perfect illustration of what bokeh is all about!<br/> <br/></td>', 'BEEEEEAUTIFUL!   How fortunate to have your circles of light be such a gorgeous blue and white.  It compliments the leaf so well.  The perfect illustration of what bokeh is all about! ', '2007-09-13 12:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087294, 579205, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Michelle!  You NAILED perfect bokeh with this one!  Congratulations.  And your 2nd highest score!  Way to go!  This is truly amazing.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Michelle!  You NAILED perfect bokeh with this one!  Congratulations.  And your 2nd highest score!  Way to go!  This is truly amazing. ', '2007-09-13 12:13:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087298, 582437, 16241, '<td valign="top">sweet sweet shot.</td>', 'sweet sweet shot.', '2007-09-13 12:15:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087304, 582524, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a striking hummingbird photo!  The light and silhouette are truly magical!<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a striking hummingbird photo!  The light and silhouette are truly magical! ', '2007-09-13 12:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087308, 580936, 24454, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!!', '2007-09-13 12:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087312, 579038, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful take on the challenge.  We don''t see too many night bokeh shots, but this is perfect!  It''s really awesome.<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a beautiful take on the challenge.  We don''t see too many night bokeh shots, but this is perfect!  It''s really awesome. ', '2007-09-13 12:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087314, 581571, 24454, '<td valign="top">Don''t you love it when you are expecting one to not do well, then it pretty much kicks butt :)  This is awesome!  And your 2nd highest score so far!  Way to go, Griz!   I love this photo.  It is absolutely perfect!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Don''t you love it when you are expecting one to not do well, then it pretty much kicks butt :)  This is awesome!  And your 2nd highest score so far!  Way to go, Griz!   I love this photo.  It is absolutely perfect! ', '2007-09-13 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087317, 582036, 24454, '<td valign="top">Mary!!!  Wow!   This is an absolutely beautiful photo.  Incredibly underrated which so surprises me because it is technically flawless, and so amazingly striking in color and composition!  10!!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Mary!!!  Wow!   This is an absolutely beautiful photo.  Incredibly underrated which so surprises me because it is technically flawless, and so amazingly striking in color and composition!  10!!!!! ', '2007-09-13 12:23:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087394, 582296, 66384, '<td valign="top">Another beauty! I love the colors and light. Excellent use of bokeh.</td>', 'Another beauty! I love the colors and light. Excellent use of bokeh.', '2007-09-13 13:01:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087411, 579205, 62318, '<td valign="top">Love the simple dangling little element. Seems like little dithering artifacts came into play (maybe because too much contrast?) Fix that and I think you would have been in top ten easily. This shot is a real grabber for attention because of the wonderful framing and the wonderful contrast between the light green and dark green in the background.<br/> <br/>I just hate webs on the head too.</td>', 'Love the simple dangling little element. Seems like little dithering artifacts came into play (maybe because too much contrast?) Fix that and I think you would have been in top ten easily. This shot is a real grabber for attention because of the wonderful framing and the wonderful contrast between the light green and dark green in the background. I just hate webs on the head too.', '2007-09-13 13:07:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087422, 582098, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the detail here and the bokeh is wonderful. The little accent of the spider web is nice, though I think a spider in the actual web would have really made the shot. Congrats on the wonderful placement.</td>', 'I like the detail here and the bokeh is wonderful. The little accent of the spider web is nice, though I think a spider in the actual web would have really made the shot. Congrats on the wonderful placement.', '2007-09-13 13:13:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087589, 580787, 77192, '<td valign="top">Wow this shot is terriffic. Can I be the first to congratulate you on your new ribbon :-)</td>', 'Wow this shot is terriffic. Can I be the first to congratulate you on your new ribbon :-)', '2007-09-13 14:47:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087631, 581699, 30214, '<td valign="top">congrats to my neighbor! wonderful light and composition</td>', 'congrats to my neighbor! wonderful light and composition', '2007-09-13 15:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087674, 582437, 74605, '<td valign="top">Your image is absolutely beautiful!  The detail, dof, and everything are great!  Well done!</td>', 'Your image is absolutely beautiful!  The detail, dof, and everything are great!  Well done!', '2007-09-13 15:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087675, 581294, 74605, '<td valign="top">What beautiful colors!  Your dof is great as well!</td>', 'What beautiful colors!  Your dof is great as well!', '2007-09-13 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087746, 580787, 66952, '<td valign="top">Really lovely. Congratulations on the yellow!</td>', 'Really lovely. Congratulations on the yellow!', '2007-09-13 16:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087748, 581433, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the great shot and the ribbon!!</td>', 'Congrats on the great shot and the ribbon!!', '2007-09-13 16:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087784, 580787, 12253, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture!  This was actually my top pick in the challenge.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Outstanding capture!  This was actually my top pick in the challenge.  Congratulations.', '2007-09-13 17:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087788, 579696, 29011, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous shot, Judy. With the subdued darker colors and the wonderful OOF background. The details on the butterfly are a tad too dark on my screen but something that doesn''t ruin the shot and could be easily tweaked in editing, if you wish to do so of course. You have the final say :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-13 16:05:27.</i></td>', 'A gorgeous shot, Judy. With the subdued darker colors and the wonderful OOF background. The details on the butterfly are a tad too dark on my screen but something that doesn''t ruin the shot and could be easily tweaked in editing, if you wish to do so of course. You have the final say :)', '2007-09-13 17:05:11.000000', '2007-09-13 17:05:27.000000', 0),
(4087804, 579432, 29011, '<td valign="top">You say you did what!? LOL. You caught 6 damsels, wow. Your yard is just alive with great bugs. Lucky doc, you have such close access to the freezer hehe. It''s a really nice shot m8, with the excellent dof and really good bokeh. It''s tack sharp and detailed but would''ve loved to see an even closer up view. These smaller red dragonflies are a pain to stalk, they''re really skiddish. Still no success in catching a glimpse of one since 3 years ago, when I was still using the point and shoot. So I can understand how getting it colder would help, but the damselflies aren''t such a pain but it does take patience/skill in subtly shooting one so they dont fly off, not as easy shooting one as those more common dragonflies.</td>', 'You say you did what!? LOL. You caught 6 damsels, wow. Your yard is just alive with great bugs. Lucky doc, you have such close access to the freezer hehe. It''s a really nice shot m8, with the excellent dof and really good bokeh. It''s tack sharp and detailed but would''ve loved to see an even closer up view. These smaller red dragonflies are a pain to stalk, they''re really skiddish. Still no success in catching a glimpse of one since 3 years ago, when I was still using the point and shoot. So I can understand how getting it colder would help, but the damselflies aren''t such a pain but it does take patience/skill in subtly shooting one so they dont fly off, not as easy shooting one as those more common dragonflies.', '2007-09-13 17:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4087911, 580787, 24454, '<td valign="top">Rita CONGRATULATIONS!  It is amazing that with all of your stunning photos this is only your first ribbon -- so much of your work is ribbon quality!  But I am so happy this one ribboned!<br/> <br/>This is just outstanding!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Rita CONGRATULATIONS!  It is amazing that with all of your stunning photos this is only your first ribbon -- so much of your work is ribbon quality!  But I am so happy this one ribboned! This is just outstanding! ', '2007-09-13 17:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088129, 580787, 28172, '<td valign="top">Wow, Thanks to everyone for the really nice comments. I feel kind of like a fraud getting this ribbon due to a disqualification of a really outstanding photo. I would like to thank my good friend Hihosilver for getting me hooked on to DPC and for taking me to my favorite place in the world to photograph birds.  We always have a lot of fun scouring the earth to find locations that will meet the next challenge.</td>', 'Wow, Thanks to everyone for the really nice comments. I feel kind of like a fraud getting this ribbon due to a disqualification of a really outstanding photo. I would like to thank my good friend Hihosilver for getting me hooked on to DPC and for taking me to my favorite place in the world to photograph birds.  We always have a lot of fun scouring the earth to find locations that will meet the next challenge.', '2007-09-13 20:28:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088138, 582306, 41047, '<td valign="top">don''t know why this didn''t score higher. i love the title and the tilt.</td>', 'don''t know why this didn''t score higher. i love the title and the tilt.', '2007-09-13 20:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088410, 582098, 66952, '<td valign="top">This is very cool! Congrats on the 4th!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-13 21:31:32.</i></td>', 'This is very cool! Congrats on the 4th!', '2007-09-13 22:31:16.000000', '2007-09-13 22:31:32.000000', 0),
(4088426, 582524, 66952, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to see this in voting. Wow! I love the silhouette against the light background, especially the transcucent feathers. Well done!</td>', 'I didn''t get to see this in voting. Wow! I love the silhouette against the light background, especially the transcucent feathers. Well done!', '2007-09-13 22:37:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088451, 582292, 48697, '<td valign="top">Nice job Pat, a new photo for your front page and nearly a PB!</td>', 'Nice job Pat, a new photo for your front page and nearly a PB!', '2007-09-13 22:48:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088456, 582400, 49804, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, a bit of harsh lighting however, this has very nice potential, i would have rather seen it on a cloudy day, on the good side however there is very nice bokeh and great composition,</td>', 'interesting shot, a bit of harsh lighting however, this has very nice potential, i would have rather seen it on a cloudy day, on the good side however there is very nice bokeh and great composition,', '2007-09-13 22:53:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088483, 580787, 65319, '<td valign="top">Hehehe...so when are you going to sell that Canon?  And buy a NIKON!!!!  A wonderful photo nonetheless and a ribbon well deserved.  Congratulations!!</td>', 'Hehehe...so when are you going to sell that Canon?  And buy a NIKON!!!!  A wonderful photo nonetheless and a ribbon well deserved.  Congratulations!!', '2007-09-13 23:07:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088541, 580787, 18870, '<td valign="top">I think hihosilver is right....sell that XTi.  but instead of a Nikon you should buy a 40D!<br/> <br/>Congrats on the great photo and well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'I think hihosilver is right....sell that XTi.  but instead of a Nikon you should buy a 40D! Congrats on the great photo and well deserved ribbon.', '2007-09-13 23:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088939, 582137, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is perfect for the challenge, for the bokeh is indeed what makes this picture to me.  I love the blurred diagonals.  Without the bee in the foreground, you have no context, so it all works together very well.  Congrats on the new PB!</td>', 'This is perfect for the challenge, for the bokeh is indeed what makes this picture to me.  I love the blurred diagonals.  Without the bee in the foreground, you have no context, so it all works together very well.  Congrats on the new PB!', '2007-09-14 04:00:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088942, 578859, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent - this has a lovely peaceful, gentle feel to it.</td>', 'Excellent - this has a lovely peaceful, gentle feel to it.', '2007-09-14 04:01:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089284, 581699, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful image with great light...congratulations on winning the blue ribbon!</td>', 'Very beautiful image with great light...congratulations on winning the blue ribbon!', '2007-09-14 09:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089289, 581433, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and light...congratulations on winning the red ribbon!</td>', 'Wonderful color and light...congratulations on winning the red ribbon!', '2007-09-14 09:46:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089292, 580787, 42100, '<td valign="top">Elegant and graceful...congratulations on winning the yellow ribbon!</td>', 'Elegant and graceful...congratulations on winning the yellow ribbon!', '2007-09-14 09:48:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089297, 582098, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and clarity...congratulations on the HM!</td>', 'Very nice color and clarity...congratulations on the HM!', '2007-09-14 09:49:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089298, 580422, 42100, '<td valign="top">Stunning, very beautiful...congratulations on the HM!</td>', 'Stunning, very beautiful...congratulations on the HM!', '2007-09-14 09:50:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089306, 582447, 42100, '<td valign="top">Another masterpiece...one of my favorites of the challenge!</td>', 'Another masterpiece...one of my favorites of the challenge!', '2007-09-14 09:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089339, 580936, 3746, '<td valign="top">not sure why this didnt place higher. great shot.</td>', 'not sure why this didnt place higher. great shot.', '2007-09-14 10:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089885, 580990, 67697, '<td valign="top">you know, I thought this was a great idea and so different from the other bokeh in the challenge.  It looked like one that had some meaning behind it.  The only thing I would really liked to have seen different, is that all of the sunflower be in focus.  I do love the concept!</td>', 'you know, I thought this was a great idea and so different from the other bokeh in the challenge.  It looked like one that had some meaning behind it.  The only thing I would really liked to have seen different, is that all of the sunflower be in focus.  I do love the concept!', '2007-09-14 13:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089887, 582235, 73601, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure for the bloom, great textures and focus, thought this would place higher.<br/></td>', 'Perfect exposure for the bloom, great textures and focus, thought this would place higher.', '2007-09-14 13:09:22.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4090066, 581877, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m so sorry to read that this photo was disqualified!  Hang in there and keep up the good work.<br/></td>', 'I''m so sorry to read that this photo was disqualified!  Hang in there and keep up the good work.', '2007-09-14 14:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4090139, 581571, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d say it did pretty well.  Marvelous shot of this guy, and the bokeh does indeed create a wonderful depth and glow to set him off nicely.  Very good work and congrats on yet another new entry in your top row.</td>', 'I''d say it did pretty well.  Marvelous shot of this guy, and the bokeh does indeed create a wonderful depth and glow to set him off nicely.  Very good work and congrats on yet another new entry in your top row.', '2007-09-14 15:00:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4090148, 579205, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love it when photographers go walking and find things and then share them.  This is marvelous, light is awesome.  And congrats on a top 20 and a new entry in your top row - very well deserved!</td>', 'I love it when photographers go walking and find things and then share them.  This is marvelous, light is awesome.  And congrats on a top 20 and a new entry in your top row - very well deserved!', '2007-09-14 15:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4090150, 582296, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the composition.  To me it expresses hope in a way - more yet to come, perhaps.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the composition.  To me it expresses hope in a way - more yet to come, perhaps.', '2007-09-14 15:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4090151, 580936, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an excellent interpretation of the challenge!!</td>', 'What an excellent interpretation of the challenge!!', '2007-09-14 15:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4090154, 582292, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well titled and the bokeh complements your "dancers" well.</td>', 'Very well titled and the bokeh complements your "dancers" well.', '2007-09-14 15:07:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4090156, 582569, 30982, '<td valign="top">Score sucks, photograph most definitely does not.  Your stuff more often than not pulls me in from the get-go.  Then makes me hang around and linger a bit.  To me, that''s a good thing.  Alternate title - Possibilities.</td>', 'Score sucks, photograph most definitely does not.  Your stuff more often than not pulls me in from the get-go.  Then makes me hang around and linger a bit.  To me, that''s a good thing.  Alternate title - Possibilities.', '2007-09-14 15:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
