(4092572, 581699, 25355, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines make for a well-deserved ribbon. Congratulations.</td>', 'Great leading lines make for a well-deserved ribbon. Congratulations.', '2007-09-15 22:54:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4092602, 581905, 47483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TDub74:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice but what happened to the nice orange one you had up? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>sorry, I deleted it thining that it might not interest any one. I will upload it again.<br/> <br/>and thanks for liking.</td>', 'Originally posted by TDub74: Nice but what happened to the nice orange one you had up?  sorry, I deleted it thining that it might not interest any one. I will upload it again. and thanks for liking.', '2007-09-15 23:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4092991, 581877, 78021, '<td valign="top">DQ''ed? :-(</td>', 'DQ''ed? :-(', '2007-09-16 03:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4093403, 579205, 75386, '<td valign="top">Great photo, great score too.  All the greens blend very well (the sharp greens on the branch along with the circular green blur in the background).<br/>and as far as being on topic...this one is pure bokeh</td>', 'Great photo, great score too.  All the greens blend very well (the sharp greens on the branch along with the circular green blur in the background).and as far as being on topic...this one is pure bokeh', '2007-09-16 10:45:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4093494, 581877, 63398, '<td valign="top">Oh! Such a shame to see your DQ!!!!! It''s still a lovely image and I''m sure you''ll get the hang of the details as you get more and more familiar with DPC. Hang in there and keep up the beautiful work!</td>', 'Oh! Such a shame to see your DQ!!!!! It''s still a lovely image and I''m sure you''ll get the hang of the details as you get more and more familiar with DPC. Hang in there and keep up the beautiful work!', '2007-09-16 11:45:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4093969, 581699, 75898, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the well deserved blue.  Brilliant choice of subject to showcase bokeh.</td>', 'Congrats on the well deserved blue.  Brilliant choice of subject to showcase bokeh.', '2007-09-16 15:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4094261, 582283, 61651, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a beautiful use of bokeh to add to the composition and gave it a 10 - this shot deserved a better score.  Beautifully lit and arranged, and I like how the bokeh is still abstractly recognizable as a beach scene, with all its paraphernalia.</td>', 'I thought this was a beautiful use of bokeh to add to the composition and gave it a 10 - this shot deserved a better score.  Beautifully lit and arranged, and I like how the bokeh is still abstractly recognizable as a beach scene, with all its paraphernalia.', '2007-09-16 17:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4094268, 582075, 61651, '<td valign="top">Absolutely loved this shot when I saw it - what a face, full of character and placed so well in the environment.  The only distraction is the red arm right next to his face, but the moment, that expression, was just right and waiting for the arm to be put down or changing the perspective to avoid it would have missed a great capture.  Very nice use of bokeh to compliment the scene - it *is* the scene. :)  This is a great shot and deserved better in the scoring.</td>', 'Absolutely loved this shot when I saw it - what a face, full of character and placed so well in the environment.  The only distraction is the red arm right next to his face, but the moment, that expression, was just right and waiting for the arm to be put down or changing the perspective to avoid it would have missed a great capture.  Very nice use of bokeh to compliment the scene - it *is* the scene. :)  This is a great shot and deserved better in the scoring.', '2007-09-16 17:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4094269, 582182, 61651, '<td valign="top">Lordy, that''s some beautiful bokeh.  Gorgeous outlining and detail in that leaf.  Congrats on a top 20!</td>', 'Lordy, that''s some beautiful bokeh.  Gorgeous outlining and detail in that leaf.  Congrats on a top 20!', '2007-09-16 17:52:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4094272, 579205, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job on this.  I love the simplicity of the whole thing - the composition, the color palette, the subject.  Stunning.  A well-deserved top 20!</td>', 'Beautiful job on this.  I love the simplicity of the whole thing - the composition, the color palette, the subject.  Stunning.  A well-deserved top 20!', '2007-09-16 17:54:41.000000', NULL, 0),
