(4094303, 582306, 61651, '<td valign="top">Most likely the "horizon" tilt was the Achilles heel, although it doesn''t bother me.  And funny you say it''s a curb, but before reading that, I thought the background was a park area, with people sitting on the grass - those two dark shadows looked like people to me.  Title is perfect - Kundera would like the shot and not fault you the "horizon".  :)</td>', 'Most likely the "horizon" tilt was the Achilles heel, although it doesn''t bother me.  And funny you say it''s a curb, but before reading that, I thought the background was a park area, with people sitting on the grass - those two dark shadows looked like people to me.  Title is perfect - Kundera would like the shot and not fault you the "horizon".  :)', '2007-09-16 18:11:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4094607, 581699, 20324, '<td valign="top">Congratulation Ann ! Very nice artistic approach to the nature photography. Great light, color and composition. Good job!</td>', 'Congratulation Ann ! Very nice artistic approach to the nature photography. Great light, color and composition. Good job!', '2007-09-16 21:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
