(4096377, 581732, 62318, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I love the brightness of the colors. Even though you shot this at a very high shutter speed, I like the feeling that there is movement in the background. I''m guessing it is coming from the bokeh produced by your lens. Great effect what ever it is.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I love the brightness of the colors. Even though you shot this at a very high shutter speed, I like the feeling that there is movement in the background. I''m guessing it is coming from the bokeh produced by your lens. Great effect what ever it is.', '2007-09-17 12:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096517, 580374, 61818, '<td valign="top">Critique Club feedback -<br/> <br/>Great use of bokeh.  Per the challenge goal, it really enhances the subject by giving a context for the scene without providing detail which steals the attention away from the ref.<br/> <br/>Composition is good, lighting is good.  This really has the feel of a late afternoon game.<br/> <br/>Pants on the ref are a bit overexposed, but I think all the important details in the rest of his outfit make up for it.<br/> <br/>If possible you should try and submit at the full dimensions allowed by the challenge rules.</td>', 'Critique Club feedback - Great use of bokeh.  Per the challenge goal, it really enhances the subject by giving a context for the scene without providing detail which steals the attention away from the ref. Composition is good, lighting is good.  This really has the feel of a late afternoon game. Pants on the ref are a bit overexposed, but I think all the important details in the rest of his outfit make up for it. If possible you should try and submit at the full dimensions allowed by the challenge rules.', '2007-09-17 13:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097769, 581877, 18450, '<td valign="top">I am sorry about the DQ Nilesh. This is a very beautiful image, be proud of it!</td>', 'I am sorry about the DQ Nilesh. This is a very beautiful image, be proud of it!', '2007-09-17 22:46:17.000000', NULL, 0),
