(4099191, 581699, 55838, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue!  Very well deserved - in fact, I think you should have received a higher 7 score for this beautiful image.  Wonderful job.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue!  Very well deserved - in fact, I think you should have received a higher 7 score for this beautiful image.  Wonderful job.', '2007-09-18 15:55:19.000000', NULL, 0),
