(4102768, 581906, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, I DO like it!!  That is one of the coolest butterfly pictures I''ve ever seen.  It''s that crystal blue, and the detail on his fuzzy feathery stuff on his little head and body.  Wow!<br/> <br/>You are batting 1,000 with your 2 challenge entries!   Keep up the fanTASTIC work, and may ALL your entries be this high scoring :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohhh, I DO like it!!  That is one of the coolest butterfly pictures I''ve ever seen.  It''s that crystal blue, and the detail on his fuzzy feathery stuff on his little head and body.  Wow! You are batting 1,000 with your 2 challenge entries!   Keep up the fanTASTIC work, and may ALL your entries be this high scoring :) ', '2007-09-19 18:37:53.000000', NULL, 0),
