(4808822, 581342, 3724, '<td valign="top">This has become one of my favorites from this challenge. The soft glow of this lens is quite beautiful. The edit is excellent &amp; the dominating bloom is beautiful, (voted this 6) but I also like it as an fine &amp; rare use (at least on dpc) of this difficult, fixed aperture, unusual lens.  I noticed the subtle <i>circular bokeh</i>, an interesting characteristic of a mirror lens, while voting, but at the time was not aware of how that could occur. My criticism would be that the crop is too tight, not enough bokeh shown.</td>', 'This has become one of my favorites from this challenge. The soft glow of this lens is quite beautiful. The edit is excellent & the dominating bloom is beautiful, (voted this 6) but I also like it as an fine & rare use (at least on dpc) of this difficult, fixed aperture, unusual lens.  I noticed the subtle circular bokeh, an interesting characteristic of a mirror lens, while voting, but at the time was not aware of how that could occur. My criticism would be that the crop is too tight, not enough bokeh shown.', '2008-07-07 10:09:07.000000', NULL, 0),
